WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Ken rushes toward the burned-out A.K.I. during knockdown recovery.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:02.550
Ken cancels the blocked crouching medium into Drive Impact.

3
00:00:02.550 --> 00:00:04.150
